  Historical successful gate:
    https://github.com/Zanark/CareerOS/actions/runs/41529974393 at 9b2903b.
  Human acceptance: latest aesthetic acceptance not inferred.
  Publication: implementation already published; no new graph code in migration.
  Limitations: no assertion that every 3D camera angle is overlap-free.

Completion log:
